From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 02:08:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] libprocessgroup: describe a cgroup-v1-only layout for msm8992

The 20.0 boot dies 3.5s in, and this is the primary cause:

  libprocessgroup: Failed to mount cgroup v2: No such device
  libprocessgroup: Failed to make and chown /sys/fs/cgroup/uid_0: No such
                   file or directory
  init: Service 'ueventd' failed to start due to a fatal error
  init: Got shutdown_command 'reboot,bootloader,bootstrap-apexd-failed'

cgroup v2 (the unified hierarchy, mounted as the 'cgroup2' filesystem type)
arrived in Linux 4.5. This device runs 3.10, whose kernel/cgroup.c contains
no cgroup2 support at all -- only the CGRP_ROOT_SANE_BEHAVIOR precursor. No
config option can add it, so /sys/fs/cgroup can never be mounted here and
every uid_/pid_ group created under it fails.

The Cgroups2 section held exactly one controller, freezer. Since
CONFIG_CGROUP_FREEZER=y and the kernel log shows the v1 freezer subsystem
initialising, that controller is re-declared as a v1 cgroup at /dev/freezer
rather than dropped. task_profiles.json refers to it by name ('Controller':
'freezer'), not by hierarchy version, so FreezerState still resolves. Marked
Optional so a mount failure degrades instead of aborting setup.

The parser already tolerates this: cgroup_map_write.cpp guards the section
with if (root.isMember("Cgroups2")), and the three CGROUPV2_CONTROLLER_NAME
lookups in processgroup.cpp either test the return value or proceed with an
empty path. None abort.

Not done via /vendor/etc/cgroups.json: that file is MERGED into the platform
descriptors rather than replacing them, so it can add entries but cannot
remove the v2 root.

Expect degraded process-group management -- KillProcessGroup and
createProcessGroup fall back to an empty hierarchy path. That is the same
trade already accepted for the missing eBPF: degrade rather than refuse to
boot.
---
 libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json | 22 +++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json b/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
index 3e4393df2..c82b6d3da 100644
--- a/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
+++ b/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
@@ -28,18 +28,14 @@
       "UID": "root",
       "GID": "system",
       "Optional": true
+    },
+    {
+      "Controller": "freezer",
+      "Path": "/dev/freezer",
+      "Mode": "0755",
+      "UID": "system",
+      "GID": "system",
+      "Optional": true
     }
-  ],
-  "Cgroups2": {
-    "Path": "/sys/fs/cgroup",
-    "Mode": "0775",
-    "UID": "system",
-    "GID": "system",
-    "Controllers": [
-      {
-        "Controller": "freezer",
-        "Path": "."
-      }
-    ]
-  }
+  ]
 }
